<P STYLE="text-align: left; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in">provided, however, that paragraphs (a)(1)(i)&nbsp;and (a)(1)(ii)&nbsp;do
not apply if the information required to be included in a post-effective amendment by those paragraphs is contained in periodic reports
